### 个人中心 API 测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{your_token_here}}

### 1. 登录获取 Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123",
  "code": "1234",
  "uuid": "test-uuid"
}

### 2. 获取个人信息（需要替换上面的 token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8

### 3. 修改个人信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8

{
  "nickName": "测试用户",
  "phonenumber": "13800138000",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "sex": "0"
}

### 4. 修改密码
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/user/profile/updatePwd
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json;charset=utf-8

{
  "oldPassword": "admin123",
  "newPassword": "admin123"
}

### 5. 上传头像
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/user/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatarfile"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
